WEBVTT

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.540
Let it catch.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.600
Through a windshield crack.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.560
Nobody owns the horizon.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.920
Nobody fences the stars.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.460
We put this thing together.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:47.120
Every dent on it is ours.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.960
Pass the wrench, pull up beside us.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.080
There's a seat on either side.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.360
Nobody owns the horizon.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.100
But we own this ride.
